[# editorial/storytelling: a narrative section: eyebrow, heading, paragraphs, an optional pull quote and an optional image.

   A reading-width column (layout/container), so long copy stays readable. Paragraphs are plain text, the quote is
   a content/quote. Use for brand stories, founder notes and behind-the-scenes.

   Compatibility
   - Outlook desktop: honored, it is a padded section with text.
   - Gmail apps: fine.
   - Dark mode: swaps via dm-* classes when on the brand surface or background color. #]
[% set nodes = [] %]
[% if data.image and s.imagePosition == 'top' %][% set _ = nodes.push({ component: 'content/image', data: { image: data.image }, settings: { padding: '0 0 @spacing.md 0' } }) %][% endif %]
[% if data.eyebrow %][% set _ = nodes.push({ component: 'decorative/eyebrow', data: { text: data.eyebrow }, settings: { align: s.align } }) %][% endif %]
[% set _ = nodes.push({ component: 'content/heading', data: { text: data.heading }, settings: { level: 'h1', tag: 'h2', align: s.align } }) %]
[% for para in data.paragraphs %][% set _ = nodes.push({ component: 'content/text', data: { text: para }, settings: { level: 'bodyLarge', align: s.align } }) %][% endfor %]
[% if data.quote %][% set _ = nodes.push({ component: 'content/quote', data: { text: data.quote, author: data.quoteAuthor }, variant: 'centered', settings: { align: 'center' } }) %][% endif %]
[% if data.image and s.imagePosition == 'bottom' %][% set _ = nodes.push({ component: 'content/image', data: { image: data.image }, settings: { padding: '@spacing.sm 0 0 0' } }) %][% endif %]
[[ c('layout/container', { content: nodes }, { settings: { maxWidth: s.maxWidth, background: s.background, hideOnMobile: s.hideOnMobile, hideOnDesktop: s.hideOnDesktop } }) ]]
